Key Insights - Superstore Sales Analysis

1.Achieved $2.30M in total sales across 5,009 orders, generating $286.4K in profit with an overall 12% profit margin.
2.Identified Technology as the highest-performing product category, making it the primary contributor to overall revenue.
3.Analyzed regional performance and found the West region to be the leading sales contributor (31.6%), while the South region showed the lowest contribution (17.1%).
4.Evaluated product-level performance, highlighting Phones and Chairs as the top-selling sub-categories that drive a significant share of sales.
5.Examined monthly sales trends to identify consistent business growth and seasonal fluctuations, supporting strategic planning and forecasting.
6.Developed an interactive Power BI dashboard featuring KPI cards, trend analysis, and dynamic filters (Region, Category, Sub-Category, Order Date, and Ship Mode) to enable efficient, data-driven decision-making.
